SUMMARY:Artist Round Up: Collaging\, Flyer Making\, and the Community Zine
LOCATION:Acadiana Center for the Arts\, 101 W Vermilion St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:AcA's Artist Roundups gather together artists and creatives for
  a casual night of making connections while also making art. By bringing a
 rtists of various backgrounds together\, Artist Roundups hope to encourage
  dialogue and collaboration across artistic disciplines and create a share
 d sense of community and belonging. This month\, join former Artist Allian
 ce member Jesse Poimboeuf for a night of collaging and mixed media artmaki
 ng as we put together the 7th issue of the Creative Acadiana Community Art
  Zine. Inspired by the grassroots flyers handmade by the Artist Alliance i
 n the 90s you'll collage flyers of your own: for real events\, fake events
 \, concepts\, or anything else you can imagine! Collaging materials will b
 e provided but you're also encouraged to bring your own. Old photos\, stic
 kers\, interestingly patterned paper. Everything 2 dimensional is fair gam
 e. Scissors will be provided but if you may also bring other cutting utens
 ils if you wish. Creatives of all levels welcome!\n\nhttps://acadianacente
 rforthearts.org/events/community-zine/?occurrence=2026-11-18
URL:https://acadianacenterforthearts.org/events/community-zine/?occurrence=
 2026-11-18
